    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.11-p006",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ১৫.** $bc(b - c) + ca(c - a) + ab(a - b)$ কে উৎপাদকে বিশ্লেষণ করো।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "bc(b - c) + ca(c - a) + ab(a - b)"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 55,
      "pdfPageEnd": 55,
