    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.11-p007",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**সমাধান:** এখানে দুটি পদ্ধতি দেখানো হয়েছে।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [],
      "pdfPageStart": 55,
      "pdfPageEnd": 55,
      "printedPageStart": 50,
      "printedPageEnd": 50,
      "reviewReasons": [],
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.11-p008",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**প্রথম পদ্ধতি:**\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n& bc(b - c) + ca(c - a) + ab(a - b) \\\\\n= & bc(b - c) + c^2a - ca^2 + a^2b - ab^2 \\\\\n= & bc(b - c) + a^2b - ca^2 - ab^2 + c^2a \\\\\n= & bc(b - c) + a^2(b - c) - a(b^2 - c^2) \\\\\n= & bc(b - c) + a^2(b - c) - a(b + c)(b - c) \\\\\n= & (b - c) \\{ bc + a^2 - a(b + c) \\} \\\\\n= & (b - c) \\{ bc + a^2 - ab - ac \\} \\\\\n= & (b - c) \\{ bc - ab - ac + a^2 \\} \\\\\n= & (b - c) \\{ b(c - a) - a(c - a) \\} \\\\\n= & (b - c)(c - a)(b - a) \\\\\n= & -(a - b)(b - c)(c - a)\n\\end{aligned}$$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\begin{aligned}\n& bc(b - c) + ca(c - a) + ab(a - b) \\\\\n= & bc(b - c) + c^2a - ca^2 + a^2b - ab^2 \\\\\n= & bc(b - c) + a^2b - ca^2 - ab^2 + c^2a \\\\\n= & bc(b - c) + a^2(b - c) - a(b^2 - c^2) \\\\\n= & bc(b - c) + a^2(b - c) - a(b + c)(b - c) \\\\\n= & (b - c) \\{ bc + a^2 - a(b + c) \\} \\\\\n= & (b - c) \\{ bc + a^2 - ab - ac \\} \\\\\n= & (b - c) \\{ bc - ab - ac + a^2 \\} \\\\\n= & (b - c) \\{ b(c - a) - a(c - a) \\} \\\\\n= & (b - c)(c - a)(b - a) \\\\\n= & -(a - b)(b - c)(c - a)\n\\end{aligned}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 55,
      "pdfPageEnd": 55,
      "printedPageStart": 50,
      "printedPageEnd": 50,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.11-p009",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**দ্বিতীয় পদ্ধতি:** প্রদত্ত রাশিটিকে $a$ এর বহুপদী $P(a)$ ধরে তাতে $a$ এর পরিবর্তে $b$ বসিয়ে দেখি যে,\n$$P(b) = bc(b - c) + cb(c - b) + b^2(b - b) = 0$$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "a",
        "P(a)",
        "a",
        "b",
        "P(b) = bc(b - c) + cb(c - b) + b^2(b - b) = 0"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 55,
      "pdfPageEnd": 55,
